@host = http://localhost:5206

### Get Products
GET {{host}}/api/data/Products

### Ask (auto validate + execute)
POST {{host}}/api/ai/ask
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question": "List products with stock below 50"
}

### Ask out-of-domain (should return Data not found)
POST {{host}}/api/ai/ask
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question": "What is the weather in Karachi today?"
}
